cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, please cite the report as below."
type: software
title: "When Protections Silently Do Not Apply: A Benchmark of ASP.NET Core Security Misconfigurations and the Tools That Miss Them"
abstract: >-
  Pairs of minimal ASP.NET Core apps, one vulnerable and one fixed, for security
  misconfigurations where a protection silently does not apply, verified at runtime
  on .NET 8 and .NET 10, with an evaluation showing that the built-in .NET analyzers,
  Semgrep and CodeQL detect none of them. The repository contains the report and
  all the code it describes.
